Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 20:28:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/11] gpu: dave2d: convert line endings from CRLF to LF

No code change. The driver files used Windows line endings; kernel sources use LF.

Signed-off-by: Pabitra Adhikari <pabitraadhikari@gmail.com>
